10173      The list will be used to label scatterplots
10174      by the sub-macro map_grp_assoc2gene4covidsexgwas*/
10175      design_width=&design_width,
10176      design_height=&design_height,
10177      barthickness=&barthickness, /*gene track bar thinkness*/
10178      dotsize=&dotsize,
