10224      and SNPs within a cluster are overlapped with each other or overlapped with elements from other SNP cluster, so it is
10224    ! feasible to
10225      avoid this issue by increasing the pct or reducing it, respectively*/
10226      yoffset4max_drawmarkersontop=&yoffset4max_drawmarkersontop,
10227      Yoffset4textlabels=&Yoffset4textlabels, /*Move up the text labels for target SNPs in specific fold;
