12377      but in each group, only positve (>0) or negative (<0) values are allowed,
12378      and all 0 axis var values will be excluded from the dsdin,
12379      the above of which are the limitations of the macro!*/
12380      axis_grp=&scatter_grp_var, /*although using the same input, this para is different from make_fake_axis_values4grps*/
12381      new_fake_axis_var=&yval_var._new,
