12537      %let ylabelsmacro_var=%sysfunc(prxchange(s/\.d+/ /,-1,&ylabelsmacro_var));
12538      %end;
12539      %else %do;
12540      *This will only remove negative values that are specific to the bottom gene tracks, and the y-axis of scatter plot will
